---
const serverTime = new Date().toISOString();
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>astro-jsx minimal SSR</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>astro-jsx minimal example</h1>
      <p>This project demonstrates the default astro-jsx integration with zero client-side JS.</p>
      <p>Server render timestamp: {serverTime}</p>
      <p>
        Add `.tsx` components and Astro islands as needed &mdash; the plugin has already configured
        TypeScript and the Vite transform for you.
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
